{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01RM2cxSQi8gQmgeoU852Gf5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed — the run is complete.\n\n**Final state:** 13/13 TODO items checked, working tree clean, 13 commits (E1–E3 + one per card). Full suite: **1257 passed** (1145 engine regression + FDN reference + 65 new SOS card tests); all ten card classes import and construct bare.\n\n**What was built:**\n\n- **Shared engine changes (E1–E3):** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (a free cast is still a cast per rule 601.2); a new `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from `advance_phase` after mana pools empty; `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` hooks from the caster's battlefield permanents.\n- **Ten cards**, each in its own `card_impl.py` with 4–10 real-engine tests, mirroring the closest FDN reference.\n\n**Engine gaps discovered and fixed beyond the plan** (all additive, engine_tests stayed green throughout):\n- `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined but never fired — now fired in `declare_attackers_step` (sos_1, also fixes Etali).\n- Stack→graveyard moves never consulted replacement effects, so \"exile it instead\" couldn't work — added `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent` through `_resolve_spell`/`move_to_zone` (sos_1).\n- Restricted mana (\"spend only on instants/sorceries\") as a parallel pool in `ManaPool` with an optional `spell=` kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay` (sos_257).\n- `card.mana_spent` recorded at cast time for \"mana spent to cast\" (sos_57).\n- Loyalty abilities had no target path — `LoyaltyAbilityInstance.targets` now writes `chosen_targets` at resolution (sos_97), plus `GameState.rng` and skip-turns handling in the turn wrap.\n\n**Notable spec-over-plan deviations** (logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, noted inline in `TODO.md`): sos_13's prepared copy is cast for its normal `{W}` cost per rule 722.3c (the plan had said free), and its ETB lives in `on_resolve` because the engine intentionally fires the ETB event before a permanent's own triggers register; sos_120's Paradigm copy uses `copy_spell` per the plan, so it doesn't re-fire cast triggers. Every card also passed an independent throwaway smoke check against the spec (e.g. converge counts *distinct* colors, casualty applies to free casts, the animated Great Hall survives cleanup's effect-reset cycle, skipped turns decrement one per would-be turn)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":318786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":587},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5fb6b059-d3b5-4b61-b723-cd48424c37bd","uuid":"9310d011-1ed5-4c18-a811-b8e03975b198","request_id":"req_011CbvePL1cDp3SPoseErTAa"}
